    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今日の収録、選手紹介がメインなんだよな。\nずっと楽しみにしてたんだ！",
      "text_ref": {
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_04:1_5_001_04:cmd-000015:dialogue:000",
        "source": {
          "scenario_id": "1_5_001tom_1_5_001_04",
          "part_id": "1_5_001_04",
          "file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_001tom/scenario_1_5_001_04.json",
          "command_index": 15,
          "field_kind": "dialogue",
          "field_ordinal": 0
        },
        "source_hash": "sha256:27e6c6219bceb05599768a225278d1efbc7387cb130792a540b1d4a6af5d3ba3"
      },
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "idol",
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "001tom",
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "001tom"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "001tom",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 5
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_001tom_1_5_001_04:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_5_001_04",
        "source_file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_001tom/scenario_1_5_001_04.json",
        "command_start": 15,
        "command_end": 15
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "その競技が好きな人は個々の選手をチェックするけど\n普段スポーツ見ない人はそこまでしないと思うんだ。",
      "text_ref": {
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_04:1_5_001_04:cmd-000020:dialogue:000",
        "source": {
          "scenario_id": "1_5_001tom_1_5_001_04",
          "part_id": "1_5_001_04",
          "file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_001tom/scenario_1_5_001_04.json",
          "command_index": 20,
          "field_kind": "dialogue",
          "field_ordinal": 0
        },
        "source_hash": "sha256:b3ff790de2739a817b0e83aa81f3bbffe73b6a83a415d5029b4f8437321f7151"
      },
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "idol",
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "001tom",
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "001tom"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "001tom",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 6
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_001tom_1_5_001_04:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_5_001_04",
        "source_file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_001tom/scenario_1_5_001_04.json",
        "command_start": 20,
        "command_end": 20
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だからさ、そこまで深く知らない人達に\n選手の魅力を伝えられるのが嬉しいんだよなぁ。",
      "text_ref": {
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_04:1_5_001_04:cmd-000023:dialogue:000",
        "source": {
          "scenario_id": "1_5_001tom_1_5_001_04",
          "part_id": "1_5_001_04",
          "file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_001tom/scenario_1_5_001_04.json",
          "command_index": 23,
          "field_kind": "dialogue",
          "field_ordinal": 0
        },
        "source_hash": "sha256:40514c9adadbde2f1f0360fcf305a4fbfaf38124daaa6c6211d771e9cea826f0"
      },
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "idol",
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "001tom",
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "001tom"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "001tom",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_001tom_1_5_001_04:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_5_001_04",
        "source_file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_001tom/scenario_1_5_001_04.json",
        "command_start": 23,
        "command_end": 23
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "選手を知ることで、さらにその競技への\n理解が深まって、見るのも楽しくなりますよね。",
      "text_ref": {
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_04:1_5_001_04:cmd-000025:dialogue:000",
        "source": {
          "scenario_id": "1_5_001tom_1_5_001_04",
          "part_id": "1_5_001_04",
          "file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_001tom/scenario_1_5_001_04.json",
          "command_index": 25,
          "field_kind": "dialogue",
          "field_ordinal": 0
        },
        "source_hash": "sha256:f9fe511f9ddcd1b16875ec1c83afe7170d626bb01fe47517735ad9cbdce02e56"
      },
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
